OL,3,GNEWSAHub for SEND learners opens at
OL,4,Aformer library site
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe first post-16 special educational
OL,7,Fneeds and disabilities (SEND) hub in
OL,8,FWokingham has opened to its first
OL,9,Fcohort after the completion of building
OL,10,Fwork.
OL,12,FThe Glade, at the former library site
OL,13,Fin Denmark Street, opened in September
OL,14,Fand aims to accommodate 40 people aged
OL,15,F16 to 25 by 2028.
OL,17,FWokingham Borough Council said its
OL,18,Fcourses were delivered by Oxford-based
OL,19,Feducation and training group Activate
OL,20,FLearning, with colleges in Berkshire,
OL,21,FOxfordshire and Surrey.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
